<title>LATVIA: EARLY AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 31.</title>
<headline>EARLY AFTERNOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 31.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines of the news, reported on Radio Latvia on Thursday in the early afternoon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Andris Shkele, former PM, could join the National Reform party (NRP), its head Aleksandrs Kirshteins, Eurominister in Shkele's government, said.</p>
<p>- The NRP will not back Guntars Krasts' coalition government.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
